nction': {'name': 'calculate_torque', 'description': 'Calculate torque.\n\nFormula:\n    τ = r * F * sin(θ)\n\nArgs:\n    force: Force in Newtons (N).\n    lever_arm: Distance from pivot in meters (m).\n    angle: Angle between force and lever arm in degrees.\n\nReturns:\n    Torque in Newton-meters (N·m).', 'parameters': {'properties': {'force': {'type': 'number'}, 'lever_arm': {'type': 'number'}, 'angle': {'default': 90.0, 'type': 'number'}}, 'required': ['force', 'lever_arm'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'calculate_work', 'description': 'Calculate mechanical work.\n\nFormula:\n    W = F * d * cos(θ)\n\nArgs:\n    force: Force in Newtons (N).\n    displacement: Displacement in meters (m).\n    angle: Angle between force and displacement in degrees.\n\nReturns:\n    Work in Joules (J).', 'parameters': {'properties': {'force': {'type': 'number'}, 'displacement': {'type': 'number'}, 'angle': {'default': 0.0, 'type': 'number'}}, 'required': ['force', 'displacement'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'calculate_energy', 'description': 'Calculate kinetic energy.\n\nFormula:\n    KE = 1/2 * m * v²\n\nArgs:\n    mass: Mass in kilograms (kg).\n    velocity: Velocity in meters per second (m/s).\n\nReturns:\n    Kinetic energy in Joules (J).', 'parameters': {'properties': {'mass': {'type': 'number'}, 'velocity': {'type': 'number'}}, 'required': ['mass', 'velocity'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'calculate_power', 'description': 'Calculate mechanical power.\n\nFormula:\n    P = W / t\n\nArgs:\n    work: Work in Joules (J).\n    time: Time in seconds (s).\n\nReturns:\n    Power in Watts (W).', 'parameters': {'properties': {'work': {'type': 'number'}, 'time': {'type': 'number'}}, 'required': ['work', 'time'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'calculate_stress', 'description': 'Calculate normal stress.\n\nFormula:\n    σ = F / A\n\nArgs:\n    force: Fo